l, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident.\n\n- **Before:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west. It was failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release marked healthy. The release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also marked unhealthy.\n- **After:** All three regions are on v2.3.0 and passing health checks, with a 0.2% error rate.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) is open and the on-call engineer has been paged. It covers the failure, the rollback and the current status. It also notes that someone needs to find the cause of the v2.3.1 failure before it's deployed again.", "type": "text"}]}]}